    "chunk_text": "a w\u00e6s se Godes wer gel\u00e6ded swa tomiddes heora, & hi \u00fea gecuron \u00e6nne of eallum \u00feam \u00dea stod se arwyr\u00f0a wer swa gel\u00e6ded betwyh \u00feam gew\u00e6pnedum w\u00e6lslihtum; \u00fea gearn he sona Mid \u00fey him w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t alyfed, & he \u00fea sona hine astrehte on \u00fea eor\u00f0an & hine geb\u00e6d. Witodlice \u00fea \u00fea he lange hwile hine geb\u00e6d, se fl\u00e6scbana, \u00fee to his cwealme gecoren w\u00e6s, Se drihtnes wer aras sona & his cneowa gebigde & a\u00feenede \u00feone sweoran. Ac \u00fea a\u00feenedum \u00feam sweoran he beseah on \u00fe\u00e6t sweord, \u00fee w\u00e6s wi\u00fe hine ut atogen. & hit is ges\u00e6d, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feis an word openlice beforan eallum \u00feam mannum gecw\u00e6de: sancte \u00dea se w\u00e6lhreowa fl\u00e6scbana, \u00fee to his cwale gecoren w\u00e6s, h\u00e6fde \u00fe\u00e6t getogene sweord on his Ac he ne mihte hine nanra \u00feinga eft ofdune l\u00e6tan, ac semninga he astifode, & up ar\u00e6rdum \u00feam \u00dea eall seo m\u00e6nigeo \u00feara Langbeardna, \u00fee gesomnod w\u00e6s to \u00fe\u00e6s dea\u00f0es w\u00e6fersyne, wear\u00f0 Witodlice \u00fea w\u00e6s Sanctulus gebeden, \u00fe\u00e6t he arise, & he \u00fea aras. He w\u00e6s gebeden, \u00fe\u00e6t he geh\u00e6lde \u00feone earm his banan, ac he \u00feon wi\u00f0soc & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: ne bidde \u00dea sona se Langbeardisca, se \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee ic cwe\u00fee him sylf forspilde \u00feone earm, \u00fea he hine a\u00fe\u00e6nede \u00de",
